17
00:00:43,440 --> 00:00:46,590
Exanthem comes from the
Greek word exanthema,

18
00:00:46,590 --> 00:00:49,740
meaning a breaking
out. So an exanthem

19
00:00:49,740 --> 00:00:51,680
is a rash that appears
abruptly and affects

20
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:54,320
several areas of the
skin simultaneously.

21
00:00:54,980 --> 00:00:57,120
Enanthem is a rash that appears

22
00:00:57,120 --> 00:00:58,940
abruptly on the
mucous membranes.

23
00:00:59,980 --> 00:01:04,300
Morbiliform means resembling
a measles rash, which

24
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:06,940
would include erythematous
macules and papules.

25
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:10,320
In general, most of
the viral exanthems

26
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:12,420
are benign. However,
in certain high-risk

27
00:01:12,420 --> 00:01:14,480
populations, they can
be quite devastating.

28
00:01:15,040 --> 00:01:17,880
Treatment is generally
supportive. There

29
00:01:17,880 --> 00:01:20,560
are a few antiviral
treatments that are

30
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:23,360
available and we will
