39
00:01:45,490 --> 00:01:48,520
For example, So, centrifugal
spread is a rash that

40
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:50,740
started on the trunk and then
spread to the extremities.

41
00:01:50,980 --> 00:01:53,020
Centripetal spread is
a rash that started on

42
00:01:53,020 --> 00:01:54,880
the extremities and then
spread to the trunk.

43
00:01:54,920 --> 00:01:58,180
And then cephalic to
caudal or cephalocaudal

44
00:01:58,180 --> 00:02:00,360
spread is a rash
that started on the

45
00:02:00,360 --> 00:02:02,400
head and then spread
