53
00:02:26,200 --> 00:02:29,540
hand foot and mouth disease,
****** simplex, pteriasis

54
00:02:29,540 --> 00:02:32,800
rosea, molluscum
contagiosum, and monkey pox.

55
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:36,840
Now classically or
historically, the five that are

56
00:02:36,840 --> 00:02:40,440
