84
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:08,910
Then the exanthem will
appear. The exanthem

85
00:04:08,910 --> 00:04:13,230
starts with a classic
slapped cheeks appearance, or

86
00:04:13,230 --> 00:04:16,750
