girls or young adults.

110
00:05:34,190 --> 00:05:38,370
It presents with a very
peridic, burning, bright

111
00:05:38,370 --> 00:05:41,050
red, papular exanthem
on the hands and the

112
00:05:41,050 --> 00:05:44,130
feet. There's a very
clear and sharp border.

113
00:05:44,550 --> 00:05:47,050
There can be associated
edema, which can

114
00:05:47,050 --> 00:05:49,470
