of the hands and feet.

115
00:05:50,430 --> 00:05:52,470
Then you might have
other symptoms such

116
00:05:52,470 --> 00:05:55,550
as fever, lymphadenopathy,
or arthralgias.

117
00:05:58,110 --> 00:06:01,370
here are a few other
examples of the rash

118
00:06:01,370 --> 00:06:04,310
that occurs with
erythema infectiosum

119
00:06:04,570 --> 00:06:08,470
the rash occurs in 15 to
20 percent of patients and

120
00:06:08,470 --> 00:06:10,670
especially in the age
range of four to 10 years

121
00:06:10,670 --> 00:06:16,970
old is most common our
second case we have a nine

122
00:06:16,970 --> 00:06:19,390
-month-old who presents to
your office with a fever

123
00:06:19,390 --> 00:06:23,290
of 102.5 degrees fahrenheit
for three days decreased

124
00:06:23,290 --> 00:06:25,970
appetite and increased
fussiness The exam is

125
00:06:25,970 --> 00:06:29,010
notable for mild cervical
