patient's symptoms?

138
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:09,910
So the answer to this case is

139
00:07:09,910 --> 00:07:13,550
HHV6, which causes roseola.

140
00:07:14,830 --> 00:07:17,990
Roseola presents
with a high fever and

141
00:07:17,990 --> 00:07:20,810
