neck, and face.

145
00:07:27,590 --> 00:07:30,050
This is an example of
centrifugal spread.

146
00:07:30,250 --> 00:07:31,930
Our treatment is supportive.

147
00:07:31,930 --> 00:07:33,730
Our diagnosis is clinical.

148
00:07:33,730 --> 00:07:36,030
And a specific note
about the transmission is

149
00:07:36,030 --> 00:07:38,390
