contact with saliva.

150
00:07:42,230 --> 00:07:45,870
HHV6 can remain latent and
reactivate later in life.

151
00:07:46,970 --> 00:07:49,170
In certain high
-risk populations, it

152
00:07:49,170 --> 00:07:51,790
can cause meningitis,
encephalitis.

153
00:07:52,890 --> 00:07:56,890
Another high-risk patient
population is those who

154
00:07:56,890 --> 00:07:59,490
have received a hematopoietic
stem cell transplant.

155
00:07:59,490 --> 00:08:02,330
In those circumstances,
you would use the

156
00:08:02,330 --> 00:08:04,730
