IgM or IgAG levels,

191
00:09:53,450 --> 00:09:58,170
PCR testing through a throat,
nasal, or urine sample,

192
00:09:58,410 --> 00:10:01,790
and viral culture through
those same sources.

193
00:10:02,940 --> 00:10:05,550
Our case asked how this
could have been prevented.

194
00:10:05,750 --> 00:10:08,970
Rubella is a component
of the MMR vaccine.

195
00:10:08,970 --> 00:10:12,270
it is a live attenuated
virus. You receive

196
00:10:12,270 --> 00:10:15,290
two doses in childhood
in the age ranges

197
00:10:15,290 --> 00:10:18,510
of 12 to 15 months
and four to six years.

198
00:10:18,730 --> 00:10:21,410
You get 95% conversion
after a single

199
00:10:21,410 --> 00:10:23,630
dose, and you achieve
lifelong immunity

200
00:10:23,630 --> 00:10:25,510
in more than 90
% of individuals.

201
00:10:25,940 --> 00:10:27,870
However, because it
is a live attenuated

202
00:10:27,870 --> 00:10:30,870
virus, one contraindication
is pregnancy.

203
00:10:33,530 --> 00:10:37,910
Rubella in a child
will cause a viral

204
00:10:37,910 --> 00:10:40,630
exanthem with a prodrome
that is usually very

205
00:10:40,630 --> 00:10:43,530
mild or absent. This
could include a low

206
00:10:43,530 --> 00:10:46,490
-grade fever, a sore
throat, or some malaise.

207
00:10:47,210 --> 00:10:48,730
Lymphadenopathy
in the posterior

208
00:10:48,730 --> 00:10:51,450
auricular occipital
region is possible.

209
00:10:51,710 --> 00:10:54,790
The exanthem is a
very fine erythematous

210
00:10:54,790 --> 00:10:58,370
maculopapular rash that
lasts one to three days.

211
00:10:58,590 --> 00:11:01,190
Generally starts on the
face and then becomes

212
00:11:01,190 --> 00:11:04,250
generalized across the rest
of the body within 24 hours.

213
00:11:04,760 --> 00:11:07,370
You can also see some
petechiae on the soft

214
00:11:07,370 --> 00:11:10,070
palate, which are referred
to as Forsheimer spots.

215
00:11:10,850 --> 00:11:14,490
Transmission can occur via
droplet or direct contact

216
00:11:14,490 --> 00:11:17,670
with nasopharyngeal
secretions, and as well as

217
00:11:17,670 --> 00:11:20,910
transplacental in the case of
congenital rubella syndrome.

218
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:25,070
Rubella peaks in late winter
and early spring. Most

219
00:11:25,070 --> 00:11:27,370
infections now occur
outside the U.S. or in under

220
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:30,950
-immunized individuals, and
the treatment is supportive.

221
00:11:32,070 --> 00:11:34,550
Here are a few
additional pictures of

222
00:11:34,550 --> 00:11:38,010
the characteristic
exanthem and then those

223
00:11:38,010 --> 00:11:40,030
Forsheimer spots
in the bottom left.

