This is a case of measles.

237
00:12:19,170 --> 00:12:21,230
Measles is one of
the most contagious

238
00:12:21,230 --> 00:12:24,410
viruses. You are
infectious four days prior

239
00:12:24,410 --> 00:12:27,010
and four days after
the onset of the rash.

240
00:12:27,550 --> 00:12:30,230
Transmission is direct
contact with large

241
00:12:30,230 --> 00:12:32,850
droplets or direct
contact with small

242
00:12:32,850 --> 00:12:36,210
droplet aerosols. The
