00:25:46,050 --> 00:25:48,110
Whitlow, which is
infection of the finger,

484
00:25:48,310 --> 00:25:50,870
herpetic gladiatorum,
which is infection

485
00:25:50,870 --> 00:25:52,870
of the face, neck,
and arms, which

486
00:25:52,870 --> 00:25:54,610
is most commonly
seen in wrestlers.

487
00:25:55,330 --> 00:25:59,810
Another specific HSV1
manifestation is eczema herpeticum.

488
00:25:59,810 --> 00:26:02,370
This is where you have
a patient who has atopic

489
00:26:02,370 --> 00:26:06,590
dermatitis and you have a
secondary infection with HSV1.

490
00:26:07,530 --> 00:26:11,270
HSV1 can also cause
erythema multiforme.

491
00:26:11,830 --> 00:26:15,630
Other presentations include
keratoconjunctivitis

492
00:26:15,630 --> 00:26:18,970
or chorioretinitis in newborns.

493
00:26:19,410 --> 00:26:24,590
The diagnosis is either
clinical or obtaining a swab

494
00:26:24,590 --> 00:26:28,290
from the vesicular fluid
or ulcer and running a PCR.

495
00:26:30,290 --> 00:26:32,570
Recurrent HSV infections can

496
00:26:32,570 --> 00:26:34,230
be triggered by sun exposure,

497
00:26:34,350 --> 00:26:35,090
menses,

498
00:26:35,410 --> 00:26:36,170
trauma,

499
00:26:36,330 --> 00:26:39,950
or other significant stress,
or decreased immunity.

500
00:26:40,230 --> 00:26:43,130
Recurrent infections
tend to be milder than in

501
00:26:43,130 --> 00:26:45,330
an initial primary
presentation in those that

502
00:26:45,330 --> 00:26:47,890
are immunocompetent.
However, recurrent

503
00:26:47,890 --> 00:26:50,190
infections can be quite
severe in immunosuppressed

504
00:26:50,190 --> 00:26:52,990
individuals where you
can have disseminated

505
00:26:52,990 --> 00:26:56,550
disease, encephalitis,
meningitis, or keratitis.

506
00:26:57,050 --> 00:27:00,230
Treatment for recurrent
infections can be supportive

507
00:27:00,230 --> 00:27:03,230
or we can also use just
as needed antivirals

508
00:27:03,230 --> 00:27:06,320
such as a cyclovir,
valacyclovir, or famciclovir.

509
00:27:07,310 --> 00:27:12,370
In those more severe cases
or in newborns, we can

510
00:27:12,370 --> 00:27:16,810
use IV antivirals. We can
also use antivirals on a

511
00:27:16,810 --> 00:27:20,970
daily basis for prophylaxis
to reduce the severity,

512
00:27:20,970 --> 00:27:23,830
frequency, and duration
of recurrent infections.

