516
00:27:37,090 --> 00:27:38,450
Face number nine,

517
00:27:38,590 --> 00:27:40,750
18 year old male presents
with a chief complaint

518
00:27:40,750 --> 00:27:43,530
of an itchy rash. The rash
started one week ago with

519
