561
00:29:58,990 --> 00:30:01,370
This child is presenting
with molluscum.

562
00:30:01,730 --> 00:30:04,990
Molluscum is characterized
by an exanthem of

563
00:30:04,990 --> 00:30:08,310
discrete flesh-colored
domed papules with

564
00:30:08,310 --> 00:30:10,670
central umbilication.
They're generally two

565
00:30:10,670 --> 00:30:13,310
to five millimeters in
size. They're commonly

566
00:30:13,310 --> 00:30:15,350
found on the trunk,
extremities, and face.

567
00:30:15,550 --> 00:30:18,130
They are mainly
asymptomatic but

568
00:30:18,130 --> 00:30:20,530
might be itchy
to some children.

569
00:30:21,520 --> 00:30:23,460
Transmission is
skin-to-skin contact

570
00:30:23,460 --> 00:30:26,130
or auto inoculation
through scratching.

571
00:30:26,490 --> 00:30:29,610
Treatment is for
cosmetic reasons and can

572
00:30:29,610 --> 00:30:33,090
include curatage,
topicals, or light therapy.

573
00:30:33,270 --> 00:30:35,810
But again, these commonly
resolve spontaneously

574
00:30:35,810 --> 00:30:39,550
over the course of anywhere
from 2 to 24 months.

