589
00:31:33,350 --> 00:31:37,110
monkeypox or mpox is a viral
zoonotic infection caused

590
00:31:37,110 --> 00:31:40,530
by the monkeypox virus
which is an orthopox virus.

591
00:31:40,530 --> 00:31:43,930
Transmission occurs via
skin-to-skin or mucosal

592
00:31:43,930 --> 00:31:47,410
contact. However, fomite
transmission is also possible.

593
00:31:47,550 --> 00:31:51,610
The prodrome consists of
fever, chills, myalgias,

594
00:31:51,610 --> 00:31:54,770
and malaise that can last
from one to five days.

595
00:31:55,210 --> 00:31:59,050
Several days after
the fever, an exanthem

596
00:31:59,050 --> 00:32:01,150
will appear on the
face and extremities

597
00:32:01,150 --> 00:32:03,430
and then exhibit
centripetal spread.

598
00:32:04,090 --> 00:32:08,110
The exanthem will also
affect the palms and soles.

599
00:32:09,050 --> 00:32:11,870
The lesions will
start as macules and

600
00:32:11,870 --> 00:32:14,690
then progress to
papules, vesicles,

601
00:32:15,050 --> 00:32:18,070
pustules, and then
eventually exhibit crusting.

602
00:32:18,910 --> 00:32:22,550
The vesicles and pustules
can be umbilicated at

603
00:32:22,550 --> 00:32:25,590
later stages, and the
crusts can be hemorrhagic.

604
00:32:26,310 --> 00:32:29,310
One of the defining features
of monkeypox is that

605
00:32:29,310 --> 00:32:31,630
the lesions in any one
area of the body will be at

606
00:32:31,630 --> 00:32:34,520
the same stage and then
progress simultaneously.

607
00:32:37,590 --> 00:32:40,130
monkeypox treatment is
generally supportive and

608
00:32:40,130 --> 00:32:42,310
most recover without any
medical intervention.

609
00:32:42,610 --> 00:32:45,430
There was an antiviral
originally developed for

610
00:32:45,430 --> 00:32:47,690
the treatment of smallpox
that has been used

611
00:32:47,690 --> 00:32:51,290
during a monkeypox outbreak
under the Expanded Access

612
00:32:51,290 --> 00:32:53,910
Investigational New
Drug Protocol in the US.

613
00:32:54,550 --> 00:32:57,990
There are two vaccines
available that may reduce the

614
00:32:57,990 --> 00:33:01,730
risk of developing monkeypox.
The The MBA vaccine is

615
00:33:01,730 --> 00:33:05,190
approved for both smallpox
and monkeypox and is made from

616
00:33:05,190 --> 00:33:08,610
a highly attenuated non
-replicating vaccinia virus.

617
00:33:09,810 --> 00:33:12,890
The ACAM2000 is a replication

618
00:33:12,890 --> 00:33:15,090
-competent smallpox vaccine.

619
00:33:15,700 --> 00:33:17,760
This is only approved
in the U.S. for

620
00:33:17,760 --> 00:33:20,490
smallpox and is only
used in select patients

621
00:33:20,490 --> 00:33:22,710
as it has a higher
rate of adverse events.

622
00:33:23,180 --> 00:33:25,510
It however can be
used for prevention

623
00:33:25,510 --> 00:33:27,470
of monkeypox under
the Expanded Access

624
00:33:27,470 --> 00:33:29,490
Investigational
New Drug Protocol.

